w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fSTl24xARWAQ7kNvwFVOGNs&_nc_oc=Adl_wdQt8LvPi7Ty4pHvJ6cRCGKds8MzXw_WGmabqK_ER5qftajrtt8fIF7pr4d5WJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz12KXCLcs-4tBGLrQbqocA5Rel6J5W9AVSIuASJ_rOxQ&oe=69B69EAA"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jBIJvF8BOnsQ7kNvwHO6EeO&_nc_oc=AdkP1wVoxKnRqnQgtKMM_I32vsPiKFrvsWSe1Q3hG7ivBMfKeo2uS3tgggAb6N31yJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz4LJEcznEYgtIyGdB9D4PL5wFUU8o7U1gMFQf0rJYvrA&oe=69B6B15E"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qSeY1vXyjPoQ7kNvwFL6l2u&_nc_oc=AdkRW_DeC8vQ3KhqeCltwTSGzPvFskbN35tmEy99X_7R7-aJYj3b5eTpRreocOOBGlk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzyqNgNPkDBY6z8JSwMujUTHxcB7eqoIxX1C3JLngVoVg&oe=69B6A031"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9